this list has about 250 members. they are most certainly not a good
representation of what is out there in the latex world. nevertheless
i would like to make a poll just to get an idea what the members of
this list think on dropping/keeping the nf prefix (or having any such
prefix)

to make not too much traffic i suggest the following procedure
(please read carefully)

  1)   you send a mail to ME that this   mittelbach@mzdmza.zdv.uni-mainz.de
       not to this list!

  2)  the subject of the mail should contain the following:

     poll: keep
     poll: scratch
     poll: do not care

      make sure that you write one of the three possibilities

  3)  i will not read the body, i will just count the mails so don't
      send something useful in the body, if you have something to raise
      it should go to the list anyway

  4)  please send one or the other. i like to use this as a test
      of how many people actually follow this list, when it wakes up
      once in a while, so if you don't care send "poll: do not care"
      but send it

frank

